@prefix crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://example.org/x> a
     crm:E1_CRM_Entity ,                                    # Keep
     <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> .   # ignore (duplicated)

### Remove

crm:E1_CRM_Entity a owl:Class .                             # disallowed namespace

<file:///dev/null> a crm:E1_CRM_Entity .                    # local IRI

### Rewrite

<http://example.org/y> a <http://cidoc-crm.org/current/E1_CRM_Entity> .

<http://cidoc-crm.org/current/E1_CRM_Entity> a owl:Class .  # disallowed

### Keep

# FIXME: https://github.com/nfdi4objects/grimpo/issues/44
# <http://example.org/x?foo[]=x> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Hello"@en .

<http://example.org/x?foo=x> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Hello"@en .
